data: {"id": "8624978d6e6449d7-thinking-parallel_evidence-1290", "run_id": "8624978d6e6449d7", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "这确认了容器确实处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态，无法获取日志。\n\n现在，让我回答关于 `query_pod_logs` 失败的问题：\n\n**失败原因分析：**\n`query_pod_logs` 工具尝试通过 observability 系统（可能是 Elasticsearch）查询 Pod 日志时，遇到了权限错误。错误信息显示：`pods \"elasticsearch-master-0\" is forbidden: User \"system:serviceaccount:mcp:mcp-server-manager\" cannot create resource \"pods/exec\" in the API group \"\" in the namespace \"monitor\"`。这意味着 observability 系统在尝试访问监控命名空间中的 Elasticsearch Pod 时没有足够的权限。\n\n**当前实体状态总结：**\n- Pod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` 处于 `Pending` 状态\n- 容器 `app` 处于 `Co", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788420600142, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

